    "faq.a3": "Several indicators are used to establish the ranking: the number of unique viewers (how many different people watched), total viewing time in hours, number of sessions, and average session duration. The main ranking is based on unique viewers, then on total time in case of a tie.",
    "faq.q4": "Are guests counted?",
    "faq.a4": "No. Only logged-in users with a Movix account are included in the ranking. Anonymous browsing sessions or guest sessions are not recorded. This is what makes the data reliable: we know exactly who watches what.",
