        hostsTitle: "Available hosts",
        hostsBody: "The main providers are 1fichier (very common, supports Movix debriding), Sendcm, DarkiBox, and occasionally others depending on the source. Availability depends on the original uploader — not every title is on every host.",
        debridTitle: "Speed it up with VIP debrider",
